	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia Christi tecum.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tuas litteras, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>frater in Christo doctissime, simul cum contionibus <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>coenę accepi bonaque fide redditę fuerunt per principem <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nostrum, cui tum primum fuerant oblate.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Gratias tibi immortales perpetuasque ago pro tua <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>non singulari, sed christiana humanitate, qua <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>hactenus es usus idque pluribus annis erga <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>nauci hominem, ne dicam inmeritissimum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Re<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ferat tuę pietati benignus deus cumulatissime <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>in tuum sinus haec aliaque beneficia, id <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>oro enixissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Nova significarem; sed vereor, ne sint antiquata; <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ita in dies punctimque cęsimque omnia mutantur, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>et vos etiamnum vestros habetis angelos, qui <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>mirabiles istos successus, clades mutationesque <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>monarchiarum Germanię significent, in primis vero <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ducis <persName ref="p18250">Mauritii</persName> et <persName>Alberthi</persName> etc.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Si ista ignoras <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>vel si sunt quaedam dubia ex <persName ref="p7073">Hospiniano</persName> certa <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>cognosces, quę habet a principe.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Mitto etiam ad te conventionem iustificationis, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>si non habes, ecclesiarum <placeName>Prutenicarum</placeName>, tum et iuditium<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>, responsa et ea de re confessionem theologorum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>academię <placeName ref="l572">Wirtenbergensis</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Illic videbis, quam turpiter <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>quidam in portu nostre salutis impegerint.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">O <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>got, biß unß gnedig und barmhertzig.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Item mitto et contentionem de communione inpiorum, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>quam iamdudum contra <persName>Angelandrum</persName> efficatia <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>dei verbi ex ecclesia nostra explosam credebamus; <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>recrudescit rursum per doctorem <persName ref="p4183">Iacobum Andreę</persName>, <placeName ref="l195">Gep<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>pingensem</placeName> concionatorem, qui principi nostro a <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>cancellis ecclesięque <foreign xml:lang="de">zur <placeName ref="l339">Neuwenburg</placeName></foreign> visitator est.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Argumenta quidem expumicata, sed invali<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>da videbis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Utinam tu responderes aliquando.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Ego nunc in eo sum labore, ut intelligat, quid sit <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Dares Entellum etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Paucis diebus habebo symmisten ex ducatu <persName>An<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>dream Althamerum</persName>.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Quis et qualis sit, ignoro; <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>si enim is est, qui Sylvam biblicam et <persName>Locos</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>scripturę discordantes complanarit, et perseverarit <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>in propositionibus postremis eius libelli, mi<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>nime mihi cum illo conveniet; illic enim obscurat <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>Christi institutum ac verba coenę carnaliter inter<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>pretatur.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Si litem mihi intenderit, ut solent <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>ista corrupta ingenia, spero me Christi filii dei <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>benigno auxilio veritatisque verbo illius argumenta <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>confutaturum etc.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Omnia, quae mitto, <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>remitte, obsecro, quamprimum poteris, frater in Christo <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>observande, ut habeam exemplaria; ex iis enim <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>adversariorum argumenta sunt mihi colligenda.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Hisce <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>vale.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta fratres omnes in Christo, inprimis <lb xml:id="p2z20"/><persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName>, <persName ref="p8171">Bibliandrum</persName> ac reliquos.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Dic <lb xml:id="p2z21"/><persName ref="p8127">Pellicano</persName>, ut se paret, id quod facit procul dubio <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>non minus atque ego, ad agonem; uterque <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>enim stamus in procinctu contra postremum <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>hostem, crudelissimam mortem, quam facile per eum, <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>qui illum prior vicit, superabimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Rursum vale <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>cum familia, et orate pro nobis.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z27"/>Reliqua ex <persName ref="p7073">Hospiniano</persName> etc.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z28"/><placeName ref="l411">Richenvillę</placeName> raptim kalendis <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>augusti 1553.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z30"/>Tuus <lb xml:id="p2z31"/><persName ref="p1010">Erbius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Eximio inprimis pietate <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>et eruditione viro <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Henrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>ecclesię <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>antistiti.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>